        {
          "text": "’Ba dria alu alu ma e’yo onzi emini kule ra ’diyi, yi ma ovu kuzaru yi dri; ’ba dria alu alu ma e’yo onzi emini kule ku ’diyi, yi ovuni kuzaru yi dri ku.",
